332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-03-18T15:27:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T03:52:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4.1.rc1, 4.4.stable\nNot reproducible in: 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.rc1 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 (nvidia; 550.120) - AMD FX(tm)-6300 Six-Core Processor (6 threads)\n\nAlso tested on Windows 11, same issue\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe 4.4 update seems to have broken the DisplayServer.window_set_title function, in 4.3 it would change the title of the window, but in 4.4 it doesn't. Setting get_tree().root.title still works, but adds the \"(DEBUG)\" after the title, meaning there's no way to get rid of it for debug builds.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/294f21c1-7a3b-4316-beb6-f697b035eedb)\n\nPossible related issue: #103171\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPlay the game, notice how the window title hasn't changed despite running DisplayServer.window_set_title in the script.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[window_set_title.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19322338/window_set_title.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104321/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}